# Log

Decisions of the person, newest entry first. Entry types: DECISION (grilling, model, plan accepted, post-hoc, deviation, override), RULE, and RELEASE. An override is `override: start RNN` (only the planner writes it, as a part of a plan) or `override: veto Q<n> RNN`.
One entry = a heading line and 1 to 4 lines of text. Exception: the grilling entry has a fixed list of lines (see the skill "grilling").
Facts about a run (checks, counts, doubts) go in `run.yaml`, not here.
